## 📁 Repository Structure

```text
ping-tool/
├── pingx/
│   ├── __init__.py         # Package metadata & exports
│   ├── cli.py              # CLI argument parser & subcommands
│   ├── diagnostics.py      # Network interfaces, gateway & host reachability
│   ├── icmp.py             # Dual-engine ICMP socket & packet handling
│   ├── dns.py              # DNS resolution & timing audit
│   ├── statistics.py       # Latency, packet loss & jitter metrics
│   ├── reporting.py        # JSON, TXT & HTML report generators
│   └── utils.py            # ANSI colors, ASCII banner & input validators
├── tests/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── test_cli.py
│   ├── test_icmp.py
│   ├── test_dns.py
│   ├── test_diagnostics.py
│   ├── test_statistics.py
│   └── test_reporting.py
├── README.md               # Documentation & usage manual
├── LICENSE                 # MIT License
├── pyproject.toml          # PEP 621 build configuration & entry points
└── requirements.txt        # Optional developer dependencies
```

